    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "我從來都是個膽小的人。初中一個夜裡，我在郊外被一頭惡犬追。我不會往安全的地方逃，被逼到絕處。",
      "expr": "02-blush"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "jialun",
      "text": "那後來怎麼了？",
      "expr": "01-murmur"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "jialun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "最危急的時候走來一個大男孩，年紀也不比我大多少。他用掃帚替我趕那隻狗。狗不怕掃帚，撲上去，在他大腿咬了一口。我尖叫。他被咬了也不吭聲，揮拳往狗的臉上打。狗才鬆口跑了。",
      "expr": "04-cold"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "家綸打了個冷顫。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "我去看他的傷，傷口裂開，血不停地透出來。他淚也沒流，還笑著說沒大礙。我扶他，自己的手一直抖。",
      "expr": "04-cold"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "jialun",
      "text": "難怪你以後看見狗就怕。",
      "expr": "02-happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "jialun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "我哪及得上他。他看見我的手在抖，還笑我：身為男子漢怎麼可以這樣膽小，將來怎麼保護喜歡的女孩子。他有個很酷的名字。",
      "expr": "05-fire"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "jialun",
      "text": "他叫甚麼名字？",
      "expr": "03-stammer"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "jialun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "游牧。依我看，他就是牧夫座的化身。",
      "expr": "01-shrug"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "jialun",
      "text": "太厲害了。我想我拍馬也及不上他。",
      "expr": "04-sad"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "jialun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "我自小拿他當偶像。可是這麼多年，我看見狗還是怕。",
      "expr": "01-shrug"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "家綸指著外面的天。天上半顆星也沒有。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "別奉承我了。我的缺點多得很。家綸你才是個百分百的好人，優點比我多。",
      "expr": "01-shrug"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "jialun",
      "text": "甚麼？我也有優點嗎？",
      "expr": "05-nod"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "jialun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "怎麼沒有？多似內蒙古的星空，不是這裡這片烏雲。",
      "expr": "02-blush"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "jialun",
      "text": "我有甚麼優點？快告訴我！",
      "expr": "01-murmur"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "jialun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "你嘛。",
      "expr": "04-cold"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "電話又響了。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "jump",
      "to": "ch08-call"
    }
  ]
}
